        ("Does AWS Backup back up S3?", "Yes. It backs up S3 buckets, with continuous backups for point-in-time recovery up to 35 days and periodic backups for longer retention. Versioning must be on. It treats the bucket as objects, not as Delta or Iceberg tables."),
